From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:17:06 -0643
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: google,gs201-aoc-mbox: Add Tensor G4
 (zumapro)

The Pixel 9a's AoC mailboxes (Tensor G4, zumapro) have gs201's register
layout: three of them, A32, F1 and P6, at 0x15200000, 0x15220000 and
0x15240000 with GIC SPIs 77 to 79, 16 doorbells each way.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs201-aoc-mbox.yaml    | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs201-aoc-mbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs201-aoc-mbox.yaml
index df919aaa4..838c338dd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs201-aoc-mbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs201-aoc-mbox.yaml
@@ -17,7 +17,9 @@ description:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: google,gs201-aoc-mbox
+    enum:
+      - google,gs201-aoc-mbox
+      - google,zumapro-aoc-mbox
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
